[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/capture_type_leads.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-rb[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-rb/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli capture.type_leads loader, bob types surfacing, rename[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]guard[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]lead_config[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lead_config: add the deploy-safe `capture.type_leads` loader with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parser-probe validation and per-entry degradation, show leads and their [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]warnings in `bob types`, guard `bob types rename`, and document the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]config key.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli task_type candidates carry an optional lead[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]lead_complete[dim] · [dim][/dim]after lead_config[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lead_complete: compute the optional `lead` object on editor `task_type` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]candidates behind Bob's eligibility gates and one parser probe, keep [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shell completion and every write path lead-free, render it in human [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]output, and document the contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac decodes the lead and previews it in the Task type menu[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_lead_preview[dim] · [dim][/dim]after lead_complete[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_lead_preview: decode `lead` tolerantly and show it as a calm `Fix…` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hint after the type pill, in the selected-row footer, and in VoiceOver, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with protocol docs and CaptureCore tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac inserts the lead undoably, peels it with one Backspace, [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]skips it on ⌘↩[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_lead_accept[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac_lead_preview[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_lead_accept: apply a lead-bearing accept as two native undo groups [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]bound to the response snapshot, arm a one-key Backspace peel, skip the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lead on Control/Command- Return, update keyboard and panel docs, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hosted tests, and watch macOS CI green.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Enable the five leads in chezmoi and verify end to end[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]lead_rollout[dim] · [dim][/dim]after lead_config, mac_lead_accept[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]lead_rollout: add the `capture.type_leads` block to the chezmoi bob [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]config, apply it, verify with a master-built bob, and write the approved[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory records.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-rb","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-rb.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-rb.1"},"source_run_id":"run-c03543017cf64aa4adde14afd015f960","started_at":"2026-11-27T20:05:25.492873+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"92258d052e0db3f0285bc0a2dba5a441849d8532c82f2414c0406cb86c795843","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-rb.4--2/chat.md","size_bytes":23286},"commits":{"digest":"21b0b843